msgstr ""
"将 ``find_features()`` 的 ``scale=`` 重命名为 ``scale_factor=``\\ （\\ "
":ref:`find_features 重命名 <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
